  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Guarantee contribution for Ambatovy Nickel Project i Madagascar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This engagement covers Denmark&apos;s contribution to the guarantee call for the EIB&apos;s loan to the Ambatovy Nickel Project i Madagascar. Denmark&apos;s contribution was 2.493522% of to total call, i.e. equal to 1,630,907.13 EUR (app. 12,1 mio. DKK), of which 611,611.57 EUR (app. 4,6 mio kr.) were already available on our member state special account (MSCA). Due to late payment, Denmark has been subject to interest of 62.039 EUR (app. 462.192 DKK). The total amount by December 2024 is thus 1,081,334.78 EUR (app. 8,064,919.19).</narrative>
  </description>
